|---------- |-------------------- |---------:|------:|--------:|----------:|
| WriteRead | \master\corerun.exe | 1.512 ms |  1.00 |  7.8125 |  58.59 KB |
| WriteRead |     \pr\corerun.exe | 1.358 ms |  0.90 |  1.9531 |  19.53 KB |
